Qt 6
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Atlas Commander uses the Qt 6 toolkit (Core, Gui, Widgets and the SVG module),
licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 (LGPLv3).

    https://www.qt.io/
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html

Qt is linked dynamically and never modified. On Linux it is the copy your
distribution provides. The Windows zip carries the Qt DLLs and plugins as
separate files beside the executable, so you can replace them with another build
of the same Qt version. The Qt source code is available from https://download.qt.io/
and, for the MSYS2 build shipped here, from https://packages.msys2.org/.

